you should see any characters (",[242,476,477],{},"users"," table) associated with the ",[242,480,307],{},"\u002F",[242,483,484],{},"identifier",".",[227,487,489],{"id":488},"_2-install-the-fivenet-plugin-on-your-gameserver","2. Install the FiveNet Plugin on Your Gameserver",[223,491,492],{},"To connect FiveNet to your gameserver:",[494,495,496,505],"ul",{},[238,497,498,499,504],{},"Download the ",[247,500,503],{"href":501,"rel":502},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Ffivenet-app\u002Fplugins\u002Ftree\u002Fmain\u002Ffivem\u002Ffivenet",[251],"FiveM Plugin code"," from GitHub.",[238,506,507],{},"Install and configure the plugin on your FiveM server.",[509,510,511,516],"callout",{},[223,512,513],{},[354,514,515],{},"Important:",[494,517,518,525],{},[238,519,520,521,524],{},"Read the ",[242,522,523],{},"README.md"," file of the plugin you install and follow the instructions to ensure optimal setup.",[238,526,527],{},"Add event triggers to your ESX plugins as required. Not all events collected by FiveNet are available in the standard ESX plugin code.",[223,529,530,531,485],{},"For additional details and step-by-step setup guidance, refer to the ",[247,532,534],{"href":533},"..\u002Fgameserver\u002Ffivem-plugin\u002Finstallation","plugin installation documentation",[227,536,538],{"id":537},"_3-configure-your-fivenet","3. Configure Your FiveNet",[223,540,541,542,545,546,549,550,553],{},"When logged in with a character selected, you must be able to enable superuser mode (controlled by config option ",[242,543,544],{},"auth.configAdminGroups"," and ",[242,547,548],{},"auth.configAdminUsers","), navigate to your \"FiveNet Settings\" (",[242,551,552],{},"\u002Fsettings\u002Fsettings"," URL path).",[223,555,556],{},"In there go over each tab and configure them to suit your servers' config, jobs and roleplay.",[223,558,559],{},"Some of the most important settings to configure here are:",[235,561,562,570],{},[238,563,564,565],{},"\"Jobs & Tracker\" Tab\n",[494,566,567],{},[238,568,569],{},"Make sure to select the correct enemployed job and grade.",[238,571,572,573],{},"\"Website\" Tab\n",[494,574,575],{},[238,576,577],{},"Make sure to set the URLs to your gameservers' privacy policy and imprint pages.",[579,580,581],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sbssI, html code.shiki .sbssI{--shiki-light:#F76D47;--shiki-default:#F78C6C;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}html.dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shi